{"posts":[{"id":"in2forex_p7_151","t":"In2forex,\n\nWe all have off days and on days. The storm will pass and sunlight will be back.\n\nCheers, MO","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":[],"m":151},{"id":"in2forex_p7_152","t":"Hi All\n\nI haven't posted for a while.\n\nI've being working hard so not much time to spend studying. I was watching EU on and off this morning. Here's the detail on the charts.\n\nChart 1 - Missed my PO - Missed the QM took entry later.\n\nChart 2 - Looking for good points for price to turn back in history\n\nChart 3 - The HTF view","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["524a582ebb24703064796e1773664b51b5343538","bf17b06b54554e9e239b06cf14e13177a9511344","624f5bf9fd932657b5ca23c352e80994fd5e469f"],"m":152},{"id":"in2forex_p7_153","t":"I'm back\n\nsaw this CPAZ trade on GU. I didn't trade it as I wasn't by my PC this morning.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["2fb07d3df681794f3df7c88ff2abee644520d89c"],"m":153},{"id":"in2forex_p7_154","t":"Just an update on the GU trade (previous post)\n\nIt would have hit my target, but this post is more about watching PA to take you out of a trade.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["ce01a946cdbde8b97fc7d78e4337f39bf31dab7c"],"m":154},{"id":"in2forex_p7_155","t":"Good to have you back In2forex, I missed your fabulous charts!","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":[],"m":155},{"id":"in2forex_p7_156","t":"Hi All\n\nDemo trades I'm in at the moment on EU taken yesterday.\n\nA bit of an up and down ride. Once again a bit early on the trigger, almost thought I had blown it, but the last trade was pure RTM., I knew exactly was was going to happen\n\nChart 1 - Trade 1\n\nChart 2 - Trade 2\n\nChart 3 - Trade 3\n\nSL is now moved to lock in some profits currently watching PA to see what next.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["a737af7923aa1817cd286dcb0b0badb83616e3ba","306071f43c7c4164fbbb31898c634286f3ab8d8b","e5f365c72cf296150583ce2c5c82911fdcc8630c"],"m":156